{"id":"000W5R","title":"Walking in Circles","author":"PrissyP","solvedCount":1,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-22T08:04:13+00:00","posted":"Heute, 08:37 Uhr","rules":"Rules\n\nChaos Construction:\n\nDivide the grid into four regions of orthogonally connected cells, and fill each region with the digits 1–9 so that digits don't repeat in any row, column or region.\n\nRegion Rule for Arrows:\n\nNo cell on the line of an arrow or double arrow lies in the same region as its circle(s). Both circles of a double arrow lie in the same region.\n\nArrows:\n\nDigits along an arrow sum to the digit in its circle.\n\nDouble Arrows:\n\nDigits along a line between two circles sum to the total of the two circled digits.\n\nCave Clues:\n\nDigits in circles (including the arrow's circles) give the number of cells (including itself) in the same region as itself seen in all horizontal and vertical directions combined. Cells of other regions block the vision.\n\nPlay in SudokuPad","solutionCode":"Row 3, left to right with a - for region borders.\nExample: 182-46-7","tags":["Sudoku","Höhle","Arrows (Variante)","Chaos Construction (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/94nuhsoqly","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/94nuhsoqly","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":6,"cols":6,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","arrows","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-22T08:04:13+00:00"}